menu "BMDS shell"

    config BMDS_SHELL_STACK_BYTES
        int "Shell task stack size (bytes, PSRAM)"
        default 65536
        range 16384 262144
        help
            Stack of each shell task, in PSRAM. The interpreter and the
            commands run on it; deep recursion is stopped with an error
            before it runs out. Each level of a function that recurses
            through $(...) takes about 2.5 KB, a plain recursive call about
            1 KB. Check the 'tasks' command's stack_free
            column before shrinking.

    config BMDS_SHELL_WORKER_STACK_BYTES
        int "Pipeline worker stack size (bytes, PSRAM)"
        default 32768
        range 8192 131072
        help
            Stack of each worker thread that runs an earlier stage of a
            pipeline. In PSRAM, so a pipeline costs internal RAM only for
            the workers' control blocks.

    config BMDS_SHELL_PRIORITY
        int "Shell task priority"
        default 2
        range 1 24
        help
            FreeRTOS priority of shell tasks. Commands run at this priority.

endmenu
